hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16845","He said: Yazid narrated to us, he said: Muhammad ibn Ishaq informed us from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father from al-Miqdad ibn al-Aswad, he said: Ali said to me: Ask the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) about a man who fondles his wife and madhi comes out of him without the water of life. He said: He washes his private part and performs his ablution for prayer."
